Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.93,0:00:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,一直前戏不插入
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.51,0:00:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题吧\N可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.36,0:00:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了吗\N这是访问
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.52,0:00:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,访问 是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.45,0:01:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,快点吧\N今天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.60,0:01:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N是前戏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.67,0:01:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道前戏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.61,0:01:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,很重要对吧\N很重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.21,0:01:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,前戏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.20,0:01:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,没有前戏的话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.15,0:01:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,世界就完了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.02,0:01:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,就完了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.16,0:01:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的稍微调查
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.50,0:01:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,最近不前戏的人很多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.97,0:01:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.91,0:01:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很笨\N你调查的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.91,0:02:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 最近年轻人都不行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.88,0:02:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,完全不前戏
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.65,0:02:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,也不性爱了 真是不行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.93,0:02:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,还调查了有一半的男性\N做爱的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.27,0:02:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,全部 三十分钟左右
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.68,0:02:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,全部三十分钟？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.15,0:02:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,是的全部 就30分钟？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.20,0:02:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,30分钟 太短了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.16,0:02:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,调戏十分钟前戏只有1分了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.64,0:02:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,和没有一样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.17,0:03:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,插入的话二十岁的人四分钟结束
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.78,0:03:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,四分钟？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.92,0:03:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样 前戏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.72,0:03:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,十五分半
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.58,0:03:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,太短了 现在的人都怎么了\N还不如不要做爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.44,0:03:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,做爱就是前戏 知道了吗\N前戏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.74,0:03:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗 舔阴多久好呢\N舔阴是最重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.44,0:03:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,十分钟 十分钟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.24,0:03:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,十分钟 是的十分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.10,0:04:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,要十分钟啊\N男性不是也要口交吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.20,0:04:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不是很爽吗\N时间越长越爽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.84,0:04:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,女人也一样 你知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.31,0:04:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你生气了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.52,0:04:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,生气了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.19,0:04:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次这么气
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.92,0:04:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你平时做爱是多久
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.79,0:04:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我是好像\N二十分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.87,0:04:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,大概二十分钟左右吧\N没有舔阴的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.41,0:04:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这样不可以吗\N不可以 没有舔阴就完事了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.68,0:04:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,前戏必须的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.90,0:05:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你交往的人都这样吗\N所以我才会非常生气
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.84,0:05:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我想打你 抱歉\N等一下 那个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.78,0:05:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你生气
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.65,0:05:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,想试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.45,0:05:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.26,0:05:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,今天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.19,0:05:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是前戏拍摄
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.93,0:05:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,前戏拍摄
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.66,0:05:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,只有前戏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.47,0:05:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,全部都是前戏 全部都是前戏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.56,0:05:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒啊 不错的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.01,0:05:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,前戏就是做爱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.35,0:05:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,AV只做前戏就好了\N真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.62,0:06:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不需要 不需要肉棒插入
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.14,0:06:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那么插入是附带品吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.76,0:06:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.94,0:06:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我来让大家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.04,0:06:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,知道前戏的好处\N大家好好看着哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.78,0:06:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,今天要重新了解下前戏
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.02,0:07:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 养身按摩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.55,0:07:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,养身来做前戏 慢慢的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.56,0:07:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,让身体放松 很不错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.16,0:07:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,很不错 可以放松就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.57,0:07:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,确实这样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.84,0:07:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,可以的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.58,0:07:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是老师吗 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.18,0:07:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,前戏老师 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.44,0:07:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,很期待
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.36,0:07:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,多多指教 老师
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.99,0:07:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,多多指教 多多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.53,0:07:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,站起来 这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.86,0:07:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那么衣服开始脱掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.14,0:07:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,失礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.34,0:08:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好香 很不错呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.82,0:08:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,脱衣服的感觉很淫荡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.05,0:08:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.96,0:09:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好滑呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.40,0:09:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.96,0:10:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那么请趴下来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.63,0:10:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,失礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.52,0:10:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,失礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.22,0:11:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.54,0:12:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.54,0:12:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,耳朵
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.81,0:12:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.15,0:12:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.60,0:12:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,那么开始腿部
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.12,0:13:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那里舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.66,0:13:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那里很舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.66,0:14:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.17,0:15:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,腰部抬起来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.69,0:17:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,下面请躺着
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.29,0:17:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,注意安全哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.11,0:17:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那么手放开
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.52,0:17:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.72,0:17:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.06,0:17:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不舒服的话告诉我哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.66,0:17:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服 真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.73,0:17:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.41,0:18:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这样摸很舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.48,0:18:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,还有另一边呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.79,0:18:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,好爽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.96,0:19:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这样好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.37,0:19:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.57,0:19:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.77,0:19:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.56,0:20:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.56,0:20:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.58,0:20:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧 糟糕啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.12,0:21:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,奶头好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.26,0:21:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,还不行哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.06,0:21:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,奶头好奇怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.14,0:21:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,舔我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.95,0:21:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好爽
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.89,0:21:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.50,0:21:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,再用力点
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.40,0:22:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.60,0:22:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,下面是下半身按摩
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.34,0:22:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,腿张开可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.40,0:22:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,吸进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.30,0:23:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,放松
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.24,0:24:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,要使用润滑油
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.84,0:24:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,所以脱了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.48,0:24:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服 放松点
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.34,0:25:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,力道没事吧 没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.53,0:25:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.41,0:25:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,摸我小穴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.94,0:25:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 摸我吧 用力
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.75,0:25:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,还有阴蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.16,0:26:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吗 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.97,0:26:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.11,0:26:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,好多水呢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.52,0:26:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这里 好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.20,0:26:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服啊 那里
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.41,0:27:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,去了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.75,0:27:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,去了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.91,0:27:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,用力弄我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.46,0:27:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.33,0:27:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.25,0:28:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,去了 去了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.65,0:29:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好多水呢 舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.94,0:30:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.75,0:30:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.16,0:30:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,去了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.59,0:32:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服 这里
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.43,0:32:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.83,0:32:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 我要肉棒
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.24,0:32:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,给我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.11,0:33:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.25,0:33:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不行别乱动 要去了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.99,0:33:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.08,0:33:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不行啊\N肉棒好吃 我要肉棒
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.62,0:33:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,肉棒勃起了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.90,0:34:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,给我肉棒 给我 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.97,0:34:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,肉棒肉棒
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.39,0:34:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.22,0:34:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,肉棒 给我肉棒
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.83,0:35:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,肉棒 给我肉棒\N不行
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.70,0:35:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样\N果然好棒啊 前戏
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.14,0:35:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,前戏好棒 我还要
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.42,0:35:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,还要 很少呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.86,0:35:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我还要
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.48,0:35:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,肉棒
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.75,0:36:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,前戏好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.43,0:36:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.43,0:36:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.03,0:36:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,前戏很重要 重要吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.50,0:36:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我都去了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.04,0:36:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,很享受呢 不要肉棒
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.91,0:36:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,知道乳腺吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.12,0:36:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道是乳腺
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.05,0:36:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道的 也试超的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.33,0:36:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.06,0:36:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那么试试看\N现在等会试试
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.34,0:36:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,只弄奶子的前戏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.34,0:36:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这个 这个
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.95,0:37:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这个 要贴这个吗
